      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think \"runAsShell\" works in this case -- this should only grant shell permissions and not change the actual UID as returned by Binder.getCallingUid(). I verified this by logging the value of Binder.getCallingUid() within a runAsShell call (it returned the CTS UID).",
